# Integration tests (Importou)

- `makeSut` with mocked repositories/DAOs/EventBus.
- Pass `membership` with `organizationId` + role — never `tenantId`.
- Assert repo spies and resulting entity status/enums.

```typescript
expect(spies.importOperationRepoSpy.findByIdOrThrow).toHaveBeenCalledWith(operationId);
expect(operation.status).toBe(ImportOperationStatus.Cancelled);
```

